Source: encspot
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Francis Russell <francis+ppa@unchartedbackwaters.co.uk>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/FrancisRussell/encspot

Package: encspot
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: console tool for detecting the encoder used to produce an MP3 file
 Attempts to identify which encoder was used to create an MP3 file and
 displays other technical attributes such as bitrate, mode, frequency,
 frame count, and reservoir usage.
